# Proxy /thisbigbaby to the Z-soundboard Netlify site.
# Canonical URL is /thisbigbaby/ WITH the trailing slash — the soundboard uses
# relative asset paths, which only resolve correctly under the trailing slash.
# Must stay above the /* SPA fallback (rules evaluated top-to-bottom).
# Note: Netlify normalizes trailing slashes when matching, so this one rule also
# catches bare /thisbigbaby. We cannot add a bare -> /thisbigbaby/ 301 (it would
# match /thisbigbaby/ too and loop). So always link with the trailing slash.
/thisbigbaby/*          https://z-sounds.netlify.app/:splat    200!

# SPA fallback for Vue Router
# Existing files (like /chase-travel/index.html) will be served first
/*    /index.html   200
